yload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commit/97cae433b2cd5c177b17ba8a3496826bce67eb4e","node_id":"C_kwDOQbHc39oAKDk3Y2FlNDMzYjJjZDVjMTc3YjE3YmE4YTM0OTY4MjZiY2U2N2ViNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commit/884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3","sha":"884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3"}],"sha":"97cae433b2cd5c177b17ba8a3496826bce67eb4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/97cae433b2cd5c177b17ba8a3496826bce67eb4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T15:35:34Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T15:35:34Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"Phase 2: Implement validation metrics system\n\nBuilt complete validation framework for testing name generation domains:\n\nCore Metrics Implemented:\n1. Capacity - Tests if domain can generate enough unique names\n   - Collision rate analysis\n   - Shannon entropy calculation (information density)\n   - Theoretical capacity estimation\n\n2. Diffuseness - Tests if names within domain are distinct\n   - Nearest-neighbor distance analysis (Levenshtein)\n   - Shape-based distance (phonetic similarity)\n   - Percentile statistics (p1, p5, median, etc.)\n   - Similar cluster detection\n\n3. Separation - Tests if domains are distinguishable\n   - Feature extraction (length, vowel ratio, bigrams, endings)\n   - Centroid calculation per domain\n   - Pairwise centroid distances\n   - Nearest-centroid classifier with cross-validation\n   - Confusion matrix analysis\n\nComponents:\n- analysis/distance.ts - String distances (Levenshtein, shape, Euclidean)\n- analysis/features.ts - Feature extraction and normalization\n- analysis/classifier.ts - Nearest-centroid classifier\n- metrics/*.ts - Validation metric implementations\n- reporters/*.ts - Console and JSON output formatters\n- cli.ts - Command-line interface with 4 commands\n\nCLI Commands:\n- capacity - Test single domain capacity\n- diffuseness - Test intra-domain distinctiveness\n- separation - Test inter-domain separation\n- all - Run all metrics together\n\nTest Results on Example Domains:\n- Elven: ✓ Passed capacity (100% unique, 3.555 entropy)\n- Dwarven: ✗ Failed diffuseness (shape distance too low)\n- All 4 domains: ✓ Passed separation (87.3% classifier accuracy)\n\nArchitecture:\n- Separate package (namegen-validation)\n- Clean separation from generation framework\n- Zod schemas for all reports\n- Type-safe throughout\n- Ready for Phase 3 (optimization)\n\nProject structure: namegen-validation/\n- src/metrics/: Core validation algorithms\n- src/analysis/: Distance, features, classification\n- src/reporters/: Output formatters\n- src/types/: Schemas and types\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8778d4ddd66367df3e7dc5f4a2b058a7dd6285be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/git/trees/8778d4ddd66367df3e7dc5f4a2b058a7dd6285be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/git/commits/884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commit/884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3","node_id":"C_kwDOQbHc39oAKDg4NDQ5MGZkODdiYjM3YTEwMzJlODRhZjUxYjY1OGMxZDI2MmY5ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commit/021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d47c5f6d25a2e","sha":"021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d47c5f6d25a2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d47c5f6d25a2e"}],"sha":"884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/884490fd87bb37a1032e84af51b658c1d262f9d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d47c5f6d25a2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T15:18:15Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T15:18:15Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"Phase 1: Implement domain-aware name generation framework\n\nImplemented complete name generation pipeline with:\n\nCore Components:\n- Zod schemas for domain configs with validation\n- Phonology generator (syllable templates, phoneme selection)\n- Morphology application (prefixes, suffixes, structures)\n- Style transforms (apostrophes, hyphens, capitalization)\n- Domain selector with scoring/ranking system\n- Main generator orchestrating full pipeline\n\nFeatures:\n- CLI with generate, test, validate, explain commands\n- Deterministic RNG with seeding support\n- Mock knowledge graph interface (for Phase 4)\n- Example domains: Elven, Dwarven, Tech, Goa''uld-style\n- Full TypeScript with strict typing\n- Config extractable for optimization (Phase 3)\n\nArchitecture:\n- Config separation: immutable (LLM) vs tunable (ML) parts\n- All cultural specifics in JSON configs, not code\n- Ready for validation metrics (Phase 2)\n- Ready for optimization algorithms (Phase 3)\n- Ready for derivative strategies (Phase 4)\n\nProject structure: world-gen-naming/\n- src/: TypeScript source\n- domains/: Example domain configs\n- Design docs: 01-04_*.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d594597ebb31a64f9ba76b2071d8e9100120367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/git/trees/4d594597ebb31a64f9ba76b2071d8e9100120367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/git/commits/021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d47c5f6d25a2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commit/021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d47c5f6d25a2e","node_id":"C_kwDOQbHc39oAKDAyMWUzYTIxOGZlZThlOGIzNDgwMTRjNzgwMGQ0N2M1ZjZkMjVhMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commit/94e9d43be51abbf4f449f2c1143c1522b5601dac","sha":"94e9d43be51abbf4f449f2c1143c1522b5601dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/penguin-tales/commits/94e9d43be51abbf4f449f2c1143c1522b5601dac"}],"sha":"021e3a218fee8e8b348014c7800d