}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/00aeaefb7d9f227f7d9f08499b643f91cebb18c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:44:00Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:44:00Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"message":"feat(api): add Portfolio_API named and external credentials to source\n\nRetrieve the Portfolio_API_Auth External Credential (OAuth 2.0 client\ncredentials with client secret, named principal\nPortfolio_API_Principal) and the Portfolio_API Named Credential (My\nDomain root) that were created in Setup (ADR-027). The consumer key and\nsecret stay in the org''s credential store and are not in metadata.\n\nVerified with a callout through callout:Portfolio_API. userinfo\nreturned the integration user, and GET /sapi/v1/skills returned 200\nwith rate-limit and cache headers.","tree":{"sha":"ff63c0257093c8d1cd9a819a7068acc03e7c8310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/trees/ff63c0257093c8d1cd9a819a7068acc03e7c8310"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/commits/00aeaefb7d9f227f7d9f08499b643f91cebb18c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/r