lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/25cf35d66e8e8f528e44fc7d33a71de487f0f230/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:09:17Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:09:17Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"message":"feat(security): add API integration profile and scope Integration_Access reads\n\nAdd the Portfolio API Integration profile (Salesforce Platform licence)\nas the run-as profile for the External Client App (ADR-027). It grants\nAPI access only, with a 30-minute session timeout so vended tokens\nexpire (ADR-028). The object CRUD and system permissions Salesforce\nadds to new Platform profiles are revoked explicitly. Only ApiEnabled\nand ApexRestServices are on, plus the three permissions the licence\nwon''t let you turn off.\n\nIntegration_Access gains read-only object access on Contact, Account,\nCertification__c, Education__c, Experience_Highlight__c,\nExperience_Skill__c, Project_Asset__c and Project_Skill__c, which the\nREST classes query. Contact and Account field permissions are cut from\n68 export leftovers (Birthdate, HomePhone, MailingAddress and others)\ndown to the nine Contact fields the API reads, so a token holder can''t\nread private Contact data. Six missing read grants on queried fields\nare added. All 57 field permissions are read-only.","tree":{"sha":"12c8f9d75a00b87fe0183234b0c8c8f6b555818e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/trees/12c8f9d75a00b87fe0183234b0c8c8f6b555818e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/com