ame":"Ryan Bumstead"},"message":"fix(security): make Integration_Access read-only per ADR-027\n\nThe integration user''s token works on every REST API as that user, so\nleast privilege is the real control. Drop create, edit and delete on\nExperience__c, Github_Cache__c, Jira_Cache__c, Project__c, Skill__c and\nTestimonial__c, and make all field permissions read-only. Nothing in\nsource references the permission set, and the cache cleanup batches run\nas the scheduling user, not the integration user.","tree":{"sha":"9d349b18b1a2513dca9a214dccccaeb85a0e82e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/trees/9d349b18b1a2513dca9a214dccccaeb85a0e82e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/commits/e37d4b809f5b160c168a38bc7edea04e5ea02461","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfoli