stead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/a79e571bc480f5f42dba4eae898fe5d28582e43e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:59:05Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:59:05Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"message":"feat(api): grant Integration_Access execute access on the REST classes\n\nThe External Client App runs as an integration user holding\nIntegration_Access (ADR-027). Add classAccesses for the nine SAPI and\nPAPI resources so that user can execute them. ApiRequestContext needs\nno grant: it is public and only called from the resources.","tree":{"sha":"6e0f3199954e30c616b22f9e193ef9473470051e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/trees/6e0f3199954e30c616b22f9e193ef9473470051e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/commits/a79e571bc480f5f42dba4eae898fe5d28582e43e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commit/a79e571bc480f5f42dba4eae898fe5d28582e43e","node_id":"C_kwDOQbefstoAKGE3OWU1NzFiYzQ4MGY1ZjQyZGJhNGVhZTg5OGZlNWQyODU4MmU0M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commit/1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3","sha":"1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3"}],"sha":"a79e571bc480f5f42dba4eae898fe5d28582e43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/a79e571bc480f5f42dba4eae898fe5d28582e43e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:57:49Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:57:49Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"message":"refactor(api): move the nine REST resources onto ApiRequestContext\n\nEvery handler now starts with ApiRequestContext.begin() and returns on\nrejection, then queries, paginates, sets its cache policy and writes\nthrough ctx.ok / ctx.error. The private addCommonHeaders, sendError,\ngetIntegerParam, getBooleanParam, extractEndpoint and extractIdFromPath\ncopies are gone. X-Request-Id and correlationId now carry the caller''s\nUUID instead of the platform request id.\n\nBehaviour changes (plan Phase 1b Step 1 decisions):\n- SAPIExperience and SAPITestimonial: max-age=300, public -> no-store,\n  no-cache, matching the spec header reference.\n- PAPIResume: no-cache -> no-store, no-cache.\n- Non-integer limit or offset is now 400 instead of the default.\n- SAPIProject 404 goes through the shared Error payload.\n\nThe three PAPI data classes gain the same throwException test hook as\nthe SAPI classes, because the 500 tests relied on a null requestURI\nthrowing, which the null-safe endpointSegment no longer does.\nRestTestUtil sends a real UUID and adds initGetRaw for header tests.\nApiRequestContextTest covers header, pagination, cache, error and\nrate-limit rules, including zero SOQL on rejection and the 429 path.","tree":{"sha":"a74bd35eabaf45a9e009aa5f5610245d8c4bc03d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/trees/a74bd35eabaf45a9e009aa5f5610245d8c4bc03d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/commits/1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commit/1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3","node_id":"C_kwDOQbefstoAKDFiMTk4MTllMDRlYjlmMDAxMWZlNTQyZDgyYzZmOWEyODgwMmY5YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commit/b23a43ecd24d2d298cd57a9bcad1ab7ed0366a7e","sha":"b23a43ecd24d2d298cd57a9bcad1ab7ed0366a7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/b23a43ecd24d2d298cd57a9bcad1ab7ed0366a7e"}],"sha":"1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/1b19819e04eb9f0011fe542d82c6f9a28802f9a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commits/b23a43ecd24d2d298cd57a9bcad1ab7ed0366a7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:56:41Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:56:41Z","email":"Bumsteadryan@gmail.com","name":"Ryan Bumstead"},"message":"feat(api): add ApiRequestContext with a pluggable rate limiter\n\nOne per-request context for every SAPI and PAPI resource (plan Phase 1b\nStep 1, ADR-025/026/027). It validates X-Request-Id (required UUID on\n/sapi/, generated when missing on /papi/) and X-API-Version (missing\nmeans v1, anything else is 400), echoes both, and owns pagination,\nthe Error payload, Cache-Control policies and rate-limit headers.\nAll rejections happen before any SOQL.\n\nRate limiting ships as headers only: ApiRateLimiter is the store seam\nand HeadersOnlyRateLimiter reports limit = remaining and never refuses,\nuntil a counter store is chosen (ADR-025 amendment). Tiers: /sapi/ 120,\n/papi/v1/ai/ 10, other /papi/ 15 per minute.","tree":{"sha":"647a82521725e80fd39193bbede1fd7f23241032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/trees/647a82521725e80fd39193bbede1fd7f23241032"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/git/commits/b23a43ecd24d2d298cd57a9bcad1ab7ed0366a7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008640?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead","id":44008640,"login":"rdbumstead","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4NjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdbumstead","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commit/b23a43ecd24d2d298cd57a9bcad1ab7ed0366a7e","node_id":"C_kwDOQbefstoAKGIyM2E0M2VjZDI0ZDJkMjk4Y2Q1N2E5YmNhZDFhYjdlZDAzNjZhN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rdbumstead/salesforce-platform-architect-portfolio/commit/7d89109bc10053ebcc32e4834416460c90c5ed51",