/api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/commits/10f806cbbde11cad0874c41c95af8200026d8942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T01:45:20Z","email":"weicheng199610@gmail.com","name":"weicheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T01:45:20Z","email":"weicheng199610@gmail.com","name":"weicheng"},"message":"fix(vue-impact): 多项目工作区收敛与 SFC 模板容错（v0.2.1）\n\n- analyzer: 显式 projectRoot 非 Vue 项目时，自动收敛到目标文件所属的 Vue 子项目\n- parser: 模板语法错误 / pug 模板 / 仅 style 的 .vue 不再产生解析警告，\n  编译器失败时回退扫描 <script> 块\n- discovery: 未发现路由时给出诊断警告\n- 新增 multi-root 与异常 SFC 测试用例，版本号升至 0.2.1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7d847d4d79c4ffbb326230ca8477f5d7d346e0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/git/trees/f7d847d4d79c4ffbb326230ca8477f5d7d346e0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/git/commits/10f806cbbde11cad0874c41c95af8200026d8942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52061593?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992","id":52061593,"login":"13837678992","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDYxNTkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992/learning-lab/commit/10f806cbbde11cad0874c41c95af8200026d8942","node_id":"C_kwDOQbrLsNoAKDEwZjgwNmNiYmRlMTFjYWQwODc0YzQxYzk1YWY4MjAwMDI2ZDg5NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992/learning-lab/commit/be079a9ee7b9a323be72a15087e276398d46ce29","sha":"be079a9ee7b9a323be72a15087e276398d46ce29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/commits/be079a9ee7b9a323be72a15087e276398d46ce29"}],"sha":"10f806cbbde11cad0874c41c95af8200026d8942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/commits/10f806cbbde11cad0874c41c95af8200026d8942"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52061593?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992","id":52061593,"login":"13837678992","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDYxNTkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/commits/be079a9ee7b9a323be72a15087e276398d46ce29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:57:43Z","email":"weicheng199610@gmail.com","name":"weicheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:57:43Z","email":"weicheng199610@gmail.com","name":"weicheng"},"message":"feat: 新增 qrcode-multi-scanner Android 多二维码扫描工具\n\nlarge-qrcode-transfer / qrcode-transfer-web 两个发送端的 Android 接收端。\n按顺序逐张扫描分片二维码，每张内容独立保存，最后拼回完整文本。\n\n- 单张扫描、多张连续扫描（扫完即停，手动点「扫描下一张」）\n- 每张独立保存、按扫描顺序拼接、复制、导出 TXT\n- 完全离线：移除 INTERNET 权限、无账号、无后端、不申请存储权限\n- 拼接顺序、防重复、文件命名等核心逻辑无 android.* 依赖，可用 JVM 单测覆盖\n\n高容量二维码识别优化（本次重点）：\n- 分析分辨率 640×480 → 1920×1440（4:3）。CameraX 的 ImageAnalysis 在无配置\n  时目标分辨率写死 640×480，高密度二维码每个 module 只剩约 2.3 像素，低于\n  ML Kit 稳定解码所需的 3–4 像素——这是扫不出来的根因。用\n  FALLBACK_RULE_CLOSEST_LOWER_THEN_HIGHER 保证设备不支持时自动降级，\n  不会出现绑定失败\n- 对焦：进入页面初始对焦（等预览真正出帧后）、点击画面重新对焦\n- 缩放：档位由设备 zoomState 推导，不假设 2× 存在；不支持则整行不显示\n- 取景框 0.72 → 0.85，补充 quiet zone 与「让二维码占满扫描框」引导\n- 连续 5 秒没扫出来才提示一次（策略返回 SHOW/HIDE/NONE，300 帧只写 UI 两次）\n- 图像零 Bitmap 转换、零缩放、零裁剪，原始 YUV 直通 ML Kit\n\n业务逻辑（单张/多张流程、数据结构、拼接、TXT、剪贴板、路由）未改动。\n\n测试：61 个 JVM 单元测试全部通过（新增 34 个覆盖缩放档位推导、失败提示策略、\n取景框几何与点击坐标换算）；assembleDebug 与 assembleRelease 均构建成功。\n\n尚未验证：真机上的相机、对焦、扫码与布局行为——构建机无 Android 设备。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0aa1e33c9afd742f07e75c12334320e90d7ba1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/git/trees/0aa1e33c9afd742f07e75c12334320e90d7ba1c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/git/commits/be079a9ee7b9a323be72a15087e276398d46ce29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52061593?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992","id":52061593,"login":"13837678992","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDYxNTkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use