eicheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:18:09Z","email":"weicheng199610@gmail.com","name":"weicheng"},"message":"add: Layout 能力增强 V2 及项目需求/设计文档\n\nLayout 增强：\n- 标签页管理（创建/切换/关闭/刷新/右键菜单）\n- 标签页拖拽排序（HTML5 Drag & Drop）\n- 标签页双击关闭\n- 标签页持久化（localStorage 保存/恢复）\n- 登录恢复与深链接恢复\n- 页面缓存（keep-alive 动态 include）\n- 主子应用标签事件同步（TAB_OPEN/TAB_CLOSE/TAB_REFRESH）\n\n新增文件：\n- src/layout/AppTabBar.vue（标签栏组件）\n- src/store/tabs.js（标签页状态管理模块）\n\n项目文档：\n- 需求文档（完整需求规格）\n- 设计文档（架构与技术方案）\n- layout 增强分析、标签页设计、测试报告等","tree":{"sha":"c5092a6613ed8d21ad1e118e4b75b1c82c242c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/git/trees/c5092a6613ed8d21ad1e118e4b75b1c82c242c8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/13837678992/learning-lab/git/commits/05d532a31cb5453a3670d57c203e9ef35fbb802f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52061593?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992","id":52061593,"login":"13837678992","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDYxNTkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/13837678992","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/13837678992/learning-lab/commit/05d532a31cb5453a3670d57c203e9ef35fbb802f","node