risma conflict\n- Updated apps/api/.env and .env.example with correct connection strings\n- Added comprehensive database setup section to apps/api/README.md\n  - Docker and Homebrew installation instructions\n  - Seeding steps and troubleshooting guide\n  - Security warnings for credential rotation\n- Replaced any[] with unknown[] in seed script for lint compliance\n- Updated docs/TODO.md marking database setup tasks complete\n- Created ai-metrics directory to fix test failures\n\nDatabase now seeds successfully:\n- 2 chambers (Commons, Lords)\n- 1 demo election\n- 3 constituencies\n- 1 motion, press release, poll\n\nRefs #97\n\n* chore: fix linting errors and TypeScript deprecation warnings\n\n- Add ignoreDeprecations: 6.0 to tsconfig.json to silence baseUrl deprecation\n- Fix biome lint errors in tools/scripts/ai/pre-cache.js:\n  - Add node: protocol to Node.js builtin imports (fs, path, url)\n  - Remove implicit return values from forEach callbacks\n\nThese are code quality improvements that don''t affect functionality.\n\n* Update .github/workflows/ai-governance.yml\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Potential fix for code scanning alert no. 168: Workflow does not contain permissions\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpGhSzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8nwQAFuHBcJ/TCsTNlTeKs8co2Y8\nD4QFZA9qEMc/+bo/5mxkCJDcFL3wN6eePhAQT210LBSjBObL6HOVG0DnUW9Zp3lK\n+9kIKNQrhUCPCNxIAsliBGxYA0SCOUjn7lDNwwvcqNDaVtqZ0fbOBFMQYCSqDGLz\n8V71J2HlV25p4Cu2tIlVoweFjMHnaQEsK/VV9plcXNc/Rw2oULN5MtAPlI/xqknY\nZEAS3lq1tssPGCWEgp8PcmucauCu2ykwcay3WKBWjL3xzwnQshj90jiWrWi6B/Fg\nqmrN6BCnyEhLZm1a1awqjWrcIkTvNIFhNKAd5qLTk37LpEmBgN6HniKmW8TzoR1p\n+FWko