received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/step-security-bot/PoliticalSphere_political-sphere/commits/5392355a5cba8720fecfce4de9468bca84e46028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-11T21:06:50Z","email":"Morgan.Lowman@outlook.com","name":"PoliticalSphere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-11T21:06:50Z","email":"Morgan.Lowman@outlook.com","name":"PoliticalSphere"},"message":"fix(ci): fix YAML syntax errors and scorecard workflow permissions\n\nCritical fixes for workflow failures:\n\n1. **deploy-argocd.yml**: Fixed YAML syntax errors\n   - Fixed unclosed string in DATABASE_URL secret description\n   - Fixed typo in workflow name field (tname → name)\n   - Resolves: \"could not parse as YAML: line 36\" error\n\n2. **scorecard.yml**: Fixed permission configuration\n   - Changed from workflow-level to job-level permissions\n   - Added read-all at workflow level, specific perms at job level\n   - Meets scorecard-action security requirements\n   - Resolves: \"global perm is set to write\" validation error\n   - See: https://github.com/ossf/scorecard-action#workflow-restrictions\n\nAll 25 workflow files now pass YAML validation.\n\nRoot cause: Our previous \"fixes\" introduced workflow-level write permissions\nwhich violated scorecard''s security model. The tool requires job-level\npermissions to prevent privilege escalation.","tree":{"sha":"8d1f64d507117310f23fe04b80560479b66ab5b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/step-security-bot/PoliticalSphere_political-sphere/git/trees/8d1f64d507117310f23fe04b80560479b66ab5b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/step-security-bot/PoliticalSphere_politic