sers/PoliticalSphere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PoliticalSphere","id":234934458,"login":"PoliticalSphere","node_id":"U_kgDODgDQug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalSphere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/step-security-bot/PoliticalSphere_political-sphere/commits/a904f1f1bcc6261112e1c976dc5d01ddbf68f5c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-11T20:54:28Z","email":"Morgan.Lowman@outlook.com","name":"PoliticalSphere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-11T20:54:28Z","email":"Morgan.Lowman@outlook.com","name":"PoliticalSphere"},"message":"fix(ci): resolve CI failures and security recommendations\n\nThis commit addresses multiple CI infrastructure issues and implements\nsecurity best practices for GitHub Actions workflows.\n\n**CI Infrastructure Fixes:**\n- Added missing `lint` script to package.json (resolves Lint & Type Check job failure)\n- Fixed Rollup optional dependency issue on Node.js v22:\n  - Moved @rollup/rollup-linux-x64-gnu to optionalDependencies\n  - Implemented clean reinstall workaround in setup-node-deps action\n  - Works around npm bug #4828 with optional dependencies\n\n**Workflow Fixes:**\n- Updated OpenSSF Scorecard action from v2.5.0 to v2.4.3 (v2.5.0 doesn''t exist)\n- Fixed Infrastructure Audit tool download URLs:\n  - Changed from /releases/latest/download/ to versioned paths\n  - Updated gitleaks v8.28.0 → v8.29.0\n\n**Security Improvements:**\n- Quoted all environment variables in shell scripts (35+ instances across 6 files)\n- Prevents shell injection and handles special characters safely\n- Improved validation script to distinguish safe vs unsafe variable usage\n- All 26 workflow/action files now pass validation with zero issues\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- .github/workflows/scorecard.yml - Fixed action version\n- .github/workflows/audit.yml - Fixed tool download URLs\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml - Quoted environment variables\n- .github/workflows/test-setup-node-action.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/workflows/application-release.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/workflows/docker.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/workflows/health-check.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/actions/setup-node/action.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/actions/quality-checks/action.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/actions/deploy/action.yml - Quoted variables\n- .github/actions/setup-node-deps/action.yml - Added npm bug workaround\n- package.json - Added lint script, optionalDependencies\n- scripts/validate-workflows.sh - Improved pattern detection\n- CHANGELOG.md - Documented all changes\n\n**Validation:**\n- scripts/validate-workflows.sh passes with 0 violations\n- npm install completes successfully\n- All security recommendations implemented\n\nSee: https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/4828\nResolves: CI pipeline failures in Unit Tests, Lint & Type Check jobs","tree":{"sha":"68b60d187ab747ad1e6dd7f79ed608a514bfa56a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/step-security-bot/PoliticalSphere_political-sphere/git/trees/68b60d187ab747ad1e6dd7f79ed608a514bfa56a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/step-security-bot/PoliticalSphere_political-sphere/git/commits/a904f1f1bcc6261112e1c976dc5d01ddbf68f5c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234934458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PoliticalS