opilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/commits/55ff8b3e0f7418976c7967f2e7eb12ff3b27bf61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T00:52:23Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Copilot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T00:52:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add CONSTITUTION.md, REPO_OVERVIEW.md, issue tracker, and process GitHub issues #148–#158 (#159)\n\n* Add CONSTITUTION.md, REPO_OVERVIEW.md, ISSUE_TRACKER.md, issue files #148-158, task files for distributed-systems/messaging/system-design, and plan #05\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/sessions/af2760b0-4c03-4871-9b32-bd8065abc420\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add system-design-primer reference, 10 Mermaid diagrams, and docs/diagrams/ directory\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/sessions/c3396d18-f1a7-4895-8f71-9ce6c3a7e605\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add complete Terraform modules (VPC/EKS/RDS/Redis/S3/IAM/KMS/ACM/ECR) and Ansible roles (docker/k8s/notes-app/monitoring/security)\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/sessions/c3396d18-f1a7-4895-8f71-9ce6c3a7e605\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix review issues: restrict RDS password chars, remove hardcoded SSH key, remove placeholder Grafana password with validation\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/sessions/c3396d18-f1a7-4895-8f71-9ce6c3a7e605\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Nx monorepo task, diagram constitution, automation reference, Cursor AI rules\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/sessions/4ac483c8-7a0f-4e2b-ae6d-7aa59489db48\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update automation/terraform/README.md\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix task-004-caching-strategy: add diagram, fix recursion, add automation reference\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/FoushWare/request-journey-client-to-server/sessions/39f1f628-5194-4089-ae9e-22ba99428e86\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Mermaid diagrams and Automation Reference sections to distributed-systems tasks\n\n- task-001: Raft roles flowchart + EKS/Docker automation refs\n- task-002: Raft election sequence diagram + EKS/Docker automation refs\n- task-003: Restate durable execution flowchart + EKS/Docker automation refs\n- task-004: Notes App create-note sequence diagram + EKS/notes-app automation refs\n- task-005: ZooKeeper ensemble/znode graph + EKS/Docker automation refs\n- task-006: ZooKeeper leader election sequence diagram + EKS/Docker automation refs\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs(messaging): add Mermaid diagrams and Automation Reference to tasks 001–005\n\nEach messaging task file now includes:\n- A ## Diagram section with a Mermaid architecture/flowchart diagram\n  illustrating the core concept (Kafka setup, DLQ flow, retry strategies,\n  partition routing, consumer group rebalancing)\n- A ## Automation Reference section pointing to the relevant ansible roles\n  (docker, kubernetes, monitoring) for production-grade IaC equivalents\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Mermaid diagrams and Automation Reference sections to 12 task files\n\n- task-001: Automation Reference only (diagrams already present)\n- task-002: flowchart for k6 → API → DB/Redis → Prometheus → Grafana\n- task-003: graph for LB → app replicas → Redis cache → PG primary/replica\n- task-012: flowchart for Developer → LocalStack → emulated AWS services\n- task-013: graph for LocalStack emulating Lambda/DynamoDB/Secrets Manager\n- task-014: sequence diagram for GitHub Actions ↔ LocalStack CI flow\n- task-015: graph comparing AWS vs DigitalOcean vs Azure services\n- task-007: sequence diagram for Notes Service → Kafka → Email Service → Mailhog\n- task-008: flowchart for async Kafka email with circuit breaker\n- task-011: sequence diagram comparing server sessions, JWT, and HttpOnly cookies\n- task-012 (security): sequence diagram for refresh token rotation and theft detection\n- task-013 (security): flowchart for CSRF protection with SameSite and Double Submit\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: FoushWare <18531447+FoushWare@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* process issues #160-162: microservices decomposition, monolith-first migration, sidecar pattern\n\n- Add issue specs: issues/issue-160.md, issue-161.md, issue-162.md\n- Add task-010-microservices-decomposition.md (4 strategies, DDD, ADR template)\n- Add task-011-monolith-to-microservices.md (Strangler Fig