te":"2025-12-04T17:59:07Z","email":"carlo-spada@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo"},"message":"feat(docs): Complete Phase 2.03 - Add ADR Index to architecture.md\n\n## Changes\n\n### architecture.md\n- Added SSOT note referencing docs/_atoms/ for authoritative ADR content\n- Added ADR Index table linking all 18 ADRs to their atom files (SYS.017-SYS.034)\n- Added \"ADR Details\" section header for inline summaries\n\n### federated-docs-audit-plan.md\n- Updated version to 6.4\n- Updated status to show Phase 2.01-2.03 COMPLETE\n- Added Phase 2.03 completion notes with all 18 ADR atoms listed\n- Added validation results (35 atoms, 0 errors)\n\n## ADR Atom Mapping\n\n| Legacy ID | Atom ID | Decision                                    |\n|-----------|---------|---------------------------------------------|\n| ADR-001   | SYS.017 | Universal Soul Orchestration                |\n| ADR-002   | SYS.018 | Event Envelope & Schema                     |\n| ADR-003   | SYS.019 | Multi-Tenant Security (RLS)                 |\n| ADR-004   | SYS.020 | Kubernetes First (Category Cluster)         |\n| ADR-006   | SYS.021 | Tri-State Memory Architecture               |\n| ADR-007   | SYS.022 | Federated Soul Registry                     |\n| ADR-008   | SYS.023 | Python for Agent Layer                      |\n| ADR-009   | SYS.024 | Cross-Runtime Contract Strategy             |\n| ADR-010   | SYS.025 | Resilience & Graceful Degradation           |\n| ADR-011   | SYS.026 | Hierarchical Pulse Architecture             |\n| ADR-012   | SYS.027 | Copilot Widget Architecture                 |\n| ADR-013   | SYS.028 | Narrative Continuity & UX Philosophy        |\n| ADR-014   | SYS.029 | Module Registration Architecture            |\n| ADR-015   | SYS.030 | Permission Enforcement Architecture         |\n| ADR-016   | SYS.031 | Soul Access Architecture                    |\n| ADR-017   | SYS.032 | Notification Delivery Architecture          |\n| ADR-018   | SYS.033 | Automated Action Explanation Pattern        |\n| ADR-020   | SYS.034 | Sibling Dependency Law                      |\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91cf6aedc5aa1993ba3d98758463c5c52b3871e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/trees/91cf6aedc5aa1993ba3d98758463c5c52b3871e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/commits/525e43a7491324615c2f1b7b8fb9449c581a8af2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217505635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada","id":217505635,"login":"carlo-spada","node_id":"U_kgDODPbfYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada/xentri/commit/525e43a7491324615c2f1b7b8fb9449c581a8af2","node_id":"C_kwDOQcVn4doAKDUyNWU0M2E3NDkxMzI0NjE1YzJmMWI3YjhmYjk0NDljNTgxYThhZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada/xentri/commit/d27b704245321879824715f0e48bfe640954b4e0","sha":"d27b704245321879824715f0e48bfe640954b4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/commits/d27b704245321879824715f0e48