 story/approach changes\n\n### Story Context Triad (4-implementation)\n- validate-story-context: Validates story context XML for dev readiness\n- amend-story-context: Amends/refreshes story context XML\n\n### Research Triad (1-analysis)\n- validate-research: Validates research for sources and actionability\n- amend-research: Amends research with fresh data and sources\n\n## Phase 1 Now Complete\n\n- 92 existing workflows audited\n- 15 new workflows created (target achieved)\n- 4 workflows updated with entity-first detection\n- Total: 107 workflows\n\n## Additional Changes\n\n- Added 26 new atoms (SYS.002-SYS.034) from previous sessions\n- Updated epics.md with atom references\n- Updated audit plan to version 6.3\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26a1d5097e0a49b893294011da7d9ab700b8b9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/trees/26a1d5097e0a49b893294011da7d9ab700b8b9d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/commits/d27b704245321879824715f0e48bfe640954b4e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217505635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada","id":217505635,"login":"carlo-spada","node_id":"U_kgDODPbfYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-sp