Z","email":"carlo-spada@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo"},"message":"feat(bmad): Implement Module Isolation Phase 3\n\nAdd interface documentation, sprint aggregation, and SLA monitoring:\n\nInterface Documentation (Phase 3.1):\n- Create docs/platform/{module}/interfaces/ structure for all modules\n- Add interface-template.md for documenting cross-module contracts\n- Add consumers field to manifest.yaml for tracking module relationships\n\nSprint Aggregation (Phase 3.2):\n- Create sprint-rollup workflow for cross-module visibility\n- Add dashboard-template.md for orchestration-level progress view\n- Workflow aggregates sprint status from all module sprint-status.yaml files\n\nSLA Automation (Phase 3.3):\n- Create cross-module-sla.yml GitHub Action (runs every 4 hours)\n- Add sla:warning label at 12 hours with reminder comment\n- Add sla:urgent label at 24 hours with escalation comment\n\nCompletes all phases of docs/platform/orchestration/module-isolation-plan.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7828de8f48be6a7c35b36a3eaffd2bb5bc6f2094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/trees/7828de8f48be6a7c35b36a3eaffd2bb5bc6f2094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/commits/04181975e73e99845faf8a642cebc21cc45faf9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217505635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada","id":217505635,"login":"carlo-spada","node_id":"U_kgDODPbfYw","organizations_ur