7b80edbecdbc8fb89e654ab76cc5297156f3d262"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217505635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada","id":217505635,"login":"carlo-spada","node_id":"U_kgDODPbfYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/commits/5d456fd622e40d3b302e70257d48895239960d16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T22:28:45Z","email":"carlo-spada@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T22:28:45Z","email":"carlo-spada@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Carlo"},"message":"docs: Restructure documentation to mirror monorepo architecture\n\nReorganize documentation into a hierarchical structure that mirrors the\nTurborepo monorepo architecture, enabling scalable documentation as we\ngrow to 700+ modules.\n\n## New Structure\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── index.md                 # Navigation hub\n├── manifest.yaml            # Machine-readable module registry\n├── platform/                # Core infrastructure (active)\n│   ├── orchestration/       # Big picture only - cross-cutting concerns\n│   ├── core-api/            # services/core-api\n│   ├── shell/               # apps/shell\n│   ├── ts-schema/           # packages/ts-schema\n│   └── ui/                  # packages/ui\n├── strategy/                # Future\n├── brand/                   # Future\n└── ...                      # Other categories\n```\n\n## Key Changes\n\n- Add docs/manifest.yaml for AI agent navigation\n- Each module is now a full BMAD project with its own:\n  - README.md, sprint-artifacts/, sprint-status.yaml\n- Migrate stories to owning modules:\n  - orchestration: 1-1, 1-7 (cross-cutting)\n  - core-api: 1-2, 1-3, 1-4, 1-6\n  - shell: 1-5\n- Update AI agent files (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md) with:\n  - Module context prompt: \"Which module are you working on?\"\n  - Navigation instructions for new structure\n- Delete transient .context.xml files (BMAD artifacts)\n\nThis architecture supports the \"Decoupled Unity\" philosophy where each\nmodule maintains autonomy while integrating seamlessly into the whole.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46f20433583cda847eea3d342cac2e52e5b0b035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/trees/46f20433583cda847eea3d342cac2e52e5b0b035"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlo-spada/xentri/git/commits/5d456fd622e40d3b302e70257d48895239960d16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217505635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/carlo-spada","id":217505635,"login":"carlo-spada","node_id":"U_kgDODPbfYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlo-spada/orgs","received_events_u