owers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelcoelho-oficial","id":14368128,"login":"rafaelcoelho-oficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzY4MTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/commits/b1a6aa72476957651ac9dbb8012ef57d009544dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-14T18:35:21Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-14T18:35:21Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"message":"feat(tenant-manager): implementar contrato gRPC completo do TenantService\n\nImplementação completa do serviço gRPC para gerenciamento de tenants com\nprotobuf, handlers e integração no main.go.\n\n**Arquivos Proto:**\n- proto/tenant.proto: Contrato completo com 7 operações RPC\n  * CreateTenant, GetTenant, UpdateTenant, DeleteTenant\n  * ListTenants, ActivateTenant, SuspendTenant\n- proto/tenant.pb.go: Tipos protobuf gerados\n- proto/tenant_grpc.pb.go: Client/Server stubs gerados\n\n**Handlers gRPC:**\n- internal/adapter/grpc/handler/tenant.go: Implementação completa\n  * Implementa interface tenantpb.TenantServiceServer\n  * Conversão entre domain DTOs e proto messages\n  * Tratamento de erros com códigos gRPC apropriados\n  * Validação de UUIDs e inputs\n\n**Integração:**\n- cmd/server/main.go: Serviço gRPC registrado e funcional\n  * Import de tenantpb adicionado\n  * RegisterTenantServiceServer ativado\n  * Interceptors configurados (logging, deadline enforcement)\n\n**Build Tools:**\n- scripts/generate-proto.sh: Script bash para geração de código\n- Makefile: Target generate-proto atualizado\n\n**Benefícios:**\n✅ API gRPC production-ready com performance superior ao REST\n✅ Type-safety com contratos protobuf\n✅ Streaming support preparado\n✅ Health checks gRPC nativos\n✅ Reflection habilitada para debugging (dev only)\n✅ Interceptors para logging e timeout enforcement\n\n**Breaking Changes:** Nenhum","tree":{"sha":"15a373ca8bb94d66876f53ce487ec525e296edce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/trees/15a373ca8bb94d66876f53ce487ec525e296edce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/commits/b1a6aa72476957651ac9dbb8012ef57d009544dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14368128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelcoelho-oficial","id":14368128,"login":"rafaelcoelho-oficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzY4MTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u