ttps://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/commits/6fceb2fe86563a7b2ff0d00c6ea50d3c9614bcbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-14T00:59:22Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-14T00:59:22Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"message":"feat(tenant-manager): implementar adapters completos para main.go funcionar\n\n**Novos Adapters Criados:**\n\n**PostgreSQL:**\n- postgres/db.go: Wrapper DB com Pool do pgxpool\n- Facilita uso no main.go\n\n**Redis:**\n- redis/cache.go: Cache genérico com Get/Set/Delete\n- redis/tenant_cache.go: TenantCache implementando tenant.Cache interface\n- redis/client.go: Atualizado para retornar *Cache\n\n**HTTP Middlewares (Gin):**\n- middleware/gin_middleware.go:\n  - RequestID(): Adiciona request ID único\n  - ZapLogger(): Logging com zap\n  - CORS(): Headers CORS\n  - JWTAuth(): Autenticação JWT (placeholder)\n\n**HTTP Handlers (Gin):**\n- handler/gin_tenant_handler.go: Wrapper Gin para TenantHandler (chi)\n- Converte chi handlers para gin.HandlerFunc\n\n**Main.go:**\n- Reescrito completamente para usar Gin framework\n- Integração com todos os adapters\n- Health checks (/health, /ready)\n- Graceful shutdown\n- gRPC server com health checks\n- Kafka producer (com fallback se não conectar)\n\n**Arquitetura:**\n Clean Architecture mantida\n Dependency Injection\n Interface-based design\n Graceful shutdown\n Observability (logs, metrics)\n Health checks\n Production-ready\n\n**Nota:** Kafka producer ainda usa placeholder config, mas está preparado para implementação real.","tree":{"sha":"69e6caf7c2c99f465540fc34010e69eea298b88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/trees