 Luis da Costa Coelho"},"message":"fix(tenant-manager): fix repository methods and add kubernetes deployment\n\nCorreções e Infraestrutura Kubernetes completa para produção.\n\n**Correções:**\n- Fix tenant/service.go: Save → Create, FindByID → GetByID\n- Corrigido todas as chamadas de repositório para usar nomes corretos\n\n**Infraestrutura Kubernetes:**\n- Dockerfile multi-stage otimizado\n- deployment.yaml com 3-10 replicas (HPA)\n- service.yaml (HTTP + gRPC)\n- configmap.yaml com configurações\n- secrets.yaml.example (template)\n- hpa.yaml com auto-scaling\n- rbac.yaml com ServiceAccount\n- DEPLOY.md completo\n\n**Features da Infraestrutura:**\n✅ Multi-stage Docker build\n✅ Non-root container (user 1000)\n✅ Health checks (liveness + readiness)\n✅ HPA baseado em CPU/Memory\n✅ Resource limits configurados\n✅ RBAC com permissões mínimas\n✅ Secrets management\n✅ ConfigMap para configuração\n✅ Graceful shutdown (15s preStop)\n✅ Anti-affinity para HA\n✅ Prometheus metrics\n✅ Production-ready\n\n**Resource Allocation:**\n- Requests: 250m CPU, 256Mi RAM\n- Limits: 500m CPU, 512Mi RAM\n- Min replicas: 3\n- Max replicas: 10\n\nStatus: Production-ready ✅","tree":{"sha":"5eda24a011c67685834b1bd4b93bab4f5a7d12ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/trees/5eda24a011c67685834b1bd4b93bab4f5a7d12ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/commits/1c00ca4f7fcbdcbd77eeae274707157e9824f7f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14368128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht