elho-oficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/commits/8151b69ded8481b46005147a77f9c89d0df8f3d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T21:38:35Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T21:38:35Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"message":"fix(tenant-manager): fix repository methods and add kubernetes deployment\n\nCorreções e Infraestrutura Kubernetes completa para produção.\n\n**Correções:**\n- Fix tenant/service.go: Save  Create, FindByID  GetByID\n- Corrigido todas as chamadas de repositório para usar nomes corretos\n\n**Infraestrutura Kubernetes:**\n- Dockerfile multi-stage otimizado\n- deployment.yaml com 3-10 replicas (HPA)\n- service.yaml (HTTP + gRPC)\n- configmap.yaml com configurações\n- secrets.yaml.example (template)\n- hpa.yaml com auto-scaling\n- rbac.yaml com ServiceAccount\n- DEPLOY.md completo\n\n**Features da Infraestrutura:**\n Multi-stage Docker build\n Non-root container (user 1000)\n Health checks (liveness + readiness)\n HPA baseado em CPU/Memory\n Resource limits configurados\n RBAC com permissões mínimas\n Secrets management\n ConfigMap para configuração\n Graceful shutdown (15s preStop)\n Anti-affinity para HA\n Prometheus metrics\n Production-ready\n\n**Resource Allocation:**\n- Requests: 250m CPU, 256Mi RAM\n- Limits: 500m CPU, 512Mi RAM\n- Min replicas: 3\n- Max replicas: 10\n\nStatus: Production-ready","tree":{"sha":"733c83c97279a22694b678cb6d83d40652dbab22","url":"https://