thub.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/commits/13e077c767152d7e982399e6ad18400a17f0b641/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-10T16:01:25Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-10T16:01:25Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"message":"feat(frontend): Add auth microfrontend with Module Federation\n\n- Create auth-mfe with authentication and authorization\n- Add 5 exportable components:\n  - LoginForm: Login form with validation\n  - RegisterForm: Registration form\n  - UserProfile: User profile display\n  - PermissionsTable: Permissions/users management\n  - RoleManager: Role management UI\n\n- Add AuthContext provider:\n  - Centralized auth state management\n  - Token management (localStorage)\n  - Permission checking\n  - Auto-load user on mount\n\n- Add custom hooks:\n  - useAuth: Auth state and actions\n  - usePermissions: Roles and permissions data\n\n- Features:\n  - Module Federation (port 3002)\n  - JWT token management\n  - Role-based access control (RBAC)\n  - Permission system\n  - Tenant user management\n  - TypeScript with complete types\n  - React Query integration\n  - Full API integration with auth-gateway\n\n- Configure Vite with Module Federation\n- Add comprehensive README with usage examples\n- Add TypeScript configurations\n\nThe microfrontend provides complete auth solution for Console app.","tree":{"sha":"eeb94499048b997d2cedb0ee77b898e6823b9347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/trees/eeb94499048b997d2cedb0ee77b898e6823b9347"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/ser