ese guide)\n  - README-en-US.md (English guide)\n  - DEPLOYMENT.md (infrastructure guide)\n\n- Add Docker and Kubernetes infrastructure\n  - Dockerfile (multi-stage build)\n  - docker-compose.yml (local development)\n  - K8s manifests (deployment, service, configmap, secrets, hpa, ingress)\n  - GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline\n\n- Add automation scripts\n  - deploy.sh (automated deployment)\n  - rollback.sh (rollback support)\n  - logs.sh (log viewing)\n  - Makefile (build automation)\n\nFeatures:\n- Stripe integration for payments\n- Credit wallet system\n- Subscription management\n- Multi-tenant support\n- Auto-scaling (HPA)\n- High availability (3-10 replicas)\n- Security hardened\n- Observability ready","tree":{"sha":"dc31d68918885f642b42628e9efe87cba926c026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/trees/dc31d68918885f642b42628e9efe87cba926c026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/commits/f91cecd63e676c8f194d5740d2cf61115beb82f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14368128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelcoelho-oficial","id":14368128,"login":"rafaelcoelho-oficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzY4MTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/st