tps://github.com/rafaelcoelho-oficial","id":14368128,"login":"rafaelcoelho-oficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzY4MTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/commits/495b0c8a6f046df586ec85bc9dc6c69010ead505/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T06:48:12Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T06:48:12Z","email":"rafaelluisdacostacoelho@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Luis da Costa Coelho"},"message":"feat: implement complete auth-gateway with OAuth2 and frontend fixes\n\n- Implement auth-gateway service with Clean Architecture\n  * Domain layer: User entities, Session, OAuthState\n  * Use case layer: Complete authentication logic\n  * Service layer: JWT token management, tenant integration\n  * Adapter layer: HTTP handlers, PostgreSQL repository, OAuth providers\n\n- OAuth 2.0 Social Login Support\n  * Google OAuth with OIDC\n  * Microsoft OAuth with Azure AD\n  * Apple Sign In with Apple\n  * State verification and automatic account linking\n\n- Authentication & Security Features\n  * User registration with validation\n  * Login with bcrypt password hashing\n  * JWT access + refresh tokens\n  * Session management with device tracking\n  * Multi-tenancy support\n  * CORS middleware\n  * Role-based access control\n\n- Database\n  * PostgreSQL migrations for users, sessions, oauth_states\n  * Indexes for performance\n  * Soft deletes support\n\n- Frontend Fixes\n  * Fix TypeScript configuration for console and website\n  * Add vite-env.d.ts for both projects\n  * Fix baseUrl configuration with ignoreDeprecations\n  * Create tsconfig.node.json files\n  * Fix user type references in components\n  * Add environment configuration files\n\n- Documentation\n  * Complete README with setup instructions\n  * API endpoint documentation\n  * OAuth provider configuration guide\n  * Database schema documentation\n  * Troubleshooting guide\n\n- Configuration\n  * Environment-based configuration\n  * Configurable JWT expiration\n  * OAuth provider settings\n  * Database connection pooling\n\nAll services are production-ready with graceful shutdown, structured logging, and comprehensive error handling.","tree":{"sha":"37bef61c393c12dfb1f2ceddd721c32fc15d390c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/trees/37bef61c393c12dfb1f2ceddd721c32fc15d390c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelcoelho-oficial/serphona/git/commits/495b0c8a6f046df586ec85bc9dc6c69010ead505","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14368128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelcoelho-oficial","id":14368128,"login":"rafaelcoelho-oficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzY4MTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rafaelcoelho-oficial/repos","site_admin":fa